  "translation": "On Sunday morning, the weather was very good. I, together with my dad and mom, often went to the park from home. There were many people in the park. We first walked to the lake. In the lake there were fish, some red and some black. The fish could swim around, very beautiful. Mom asked: 'Do you like red or black?' I said: 'I like red, not black.' Dad said: 'These fish are really beautiful!' We also walked to the grass and sat down. We ate a piece of bread, didn't drink water, only drank a cup of milk. We all happily played on the grass, very happy. In the afternoon we went home, Mom asked: 'What time is it now?' I said: 'It's three in the afternoon.' Today is really a good day."
